<title>USA: Clinton nominates Sheila Anthony FTC commissioner.</title>
<headline>Clinton nominates Sheila Anthony FTC commissioner.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Bill Clinton has nominated Sheila Anthony, Assitant Attorney General for legislative affairs at the Justice Department, as a Federal Trade Commission commissioner, the White House said Friday.</p>
<p>The FTC is an independent federal agency responsible for enforcing competition and consumer protection.</p>
